# Settings > Screen > PDA mode (report 043, phase S7b) on the PDA install profile (480x800: the Pi 3A+ 4.3" DSI turned,
# rotate 90, pi3a-wsdsi43-portrait) and on the FZ-M1 tablet turned to portrait (800x1280 rotate 90, 150x93 mm, the
# portrait canvas the setting gives the tablet): the panel as it shows the home grid (panelshot: the picture's top at
# the landscape panel's right edge, the device turned a quarter to the left), the Screen section with the row and its
# value (On rotate left: the profile's own side while nothing is stored), the list of the three values with the check on
# it, the restart question when another value is picked (Cancel / Restart, over the list), and Esc: the question goes,
# nothing is stored, the check stays. Every header is checked against the home grid's (run.sh header). Golden at
# 480x800.
title pda mode
sizes 480x800 800x1280
profile pda
@800x1280 env APPLAUNCH_BOARD pc-fzm1-2
@800x1280 env APPLAUNCH_PANEL_MM 150x93
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
header home
panelshot pda_mode_panel_left
launch Settings
key ENTER
wait 300
expect_rows Brightness DarkTime "PDA mode"
expect_text "On rotate left"
shot pda_mode_screen
header pda_mode_screen "Settings > Screen" Screen
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 300
expect_rows Off "On rotate left" "On rotate right"
shot pda_mode_choice
header pda_mode_choice "Settings > Screen > PDA mode" "Screen > PDA mode" "PDA mode"
# On rotate right: the question first
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 300
expect_text "Restart the launcher?"
expect_text Cancel
expect_text Restart
shot pda_mode_dialog
# Esc answers Cancel: the list again, the check still on On rotate left
key ESC
wait 300
expect_rows Off "On rotate left" "On rotate right"
shot pda_mode_cancelled
key ESC
wait 300
expect_text "On rotate left"
